      "title": "Alertmanager instances discovered",
      "description": "Number of discovered Alertmanager endpoints; verifies routing discovery. Healthy: 1 in this single-instance setup. Investigate: 0 or unexpected loss of discovery. Action: Inspect Prometheus /api/v1/alertmanagers and monitoring-alertmanager endpoints.",
